# DAYMARK Environment Configuration (NaSCon '26)

# Optional: Google Gemini API Key (100% Free Tier)
# Get a free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey (Zero credit card needed)
# When set, powers Gemini 1.5 Flash executive takeaways & editorial lens analysis.
